<title>USA: Delta Financial Q1 shr profit $0.45.</title>
<headline>Delta Financial Q1 shr profit $0.45.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Financial Corporation and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			  (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    March 31,</p>
<p> Revenues:				  1997		1996</p>
<p>   Net gain on sale of loans     $ 17,314	  $   103</p>
