<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>   of shares outstanding(1)(2)(3)  15,421	   12,629 (1)</p>
<p>Prior to October 31, 1996, Delta Funding Corporation (the Company's wholly-owned subsidiary) was treated as an S corporation for federal and state income tax purposes.  The pro forma presentation reflects a provision for income taxes as if the Company had always been a C corporation at an assumed tax rate of 43%.</p>
<p>(2) Pro forma net income per share has been computed by dividing pro forma net income by the 10,653,000 shares of Delta Financial Corporation common stock received by the former shareholders of Delta Funding Corporation in exchange for their shares of Delta Funding Corporation's common stock, and the effect of the issuance of 4,600,000 shares of Delta Financial Corporation common stock in connection with its initial public offering.</p>
<p>(3) Pro forma presentations for the three months ended March 31, 1996.</p>
